<section class="section">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <h1>Terms of service</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: 20 September 2026</p>

    <div class="prose">
      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        <%= settings.siteName || 'WooHelperPro' %> designs, builds and operates e-commerce
        websites for businesses in Bangladesh. These terms govern your use of this website and
        any website we build for you.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Accounts</h2>
      <p>
        You must give accurate contact details when you open an account. You are responsible for
        keeping your password secret. Notify us immediately at
        <a href="mailto:<%= settings.supportEmail || 'support@woohelperpro.com' %>"><%= settings.supportEmail || 'support@woohelperpro.com' %></a>
        if you believe someone else has access to your account.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Orders and scope</h2>
      <p>
        An order becomes binding when we confirm it and the first payment is verified. The scope
        of work is what is described on the package page you ordered, plus anything we confirm in
        writing afterwards. Changes to scope may change the price and the delivery date.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Your content</h2>
      <p>
        You keep ownership of the logos, product photos, product descriptions and other material
        you give us. You confirm you have the right to use it. We keep ownership of our own
        frameworks, tooling and reusable components.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Delivery</h2>
      <p>
        Delivery estimates count from the later of payment verification and receipt of your
        content. Delays caused by missing content, third-party domain registrars or payment
        verification are not our responsibility.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Subscriptions</h2>
      <p>
        Subscription plans cover hosting, security updates, backups and support tickets for the
        billing period you chose. If payment is not received by the due date, service may be
        suspended after the grace period. You can cancel at any time; cancellation stops the next
        renewal rather than refunding the current period.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Payments</h2>
      <p>
        We accept bKash, Nagad, Rocket and bank transfer. Manual transfers are verified by a
        member of our team, usually within one business day. Prices are quoted in Bangladeshi
        Taka and include applicable VAT unless stated otherwise.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>
        You may not use our services to sell illegal goods, counterfeit products, or anything
        prohibited by Bangladeshi law or by your payment provider's rules. We may suspend a site
        that breaches this section.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        Our total liability for any claim is limited to the fees you paid us in the three months
        before the claim. We are not liable for lost profit, lost sales or indirect losses.
      </p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms:
        <a href="mailto:<%= settings.supportEmail || 'support@woohelperpro.com' %>"><%= settings.supportEmail || 'support@woohelperpro.com' %></a>
        <% if (settings.supportPhone) { %>
          or <a href="tel:<%= settings.supportPhone %>"><%= settings.supportPhone %></a>
        <% } %>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
